    money: "Friend does not generate money; it shares it. Income usually comes from your own labor rather than from investment or patronage, and finances stay steadier when they are kept separate from friends and siblings. Partnerships can work if roles and shares are written down early. Loans to peers are the classic leak. When Friend is strong and the wealth stars are weak, budget conservatively and build a personal buffer, because this chart spends easily on people.",
