    money: "Eating God earns by producing: a dish, a design, a lesson, a service people come back for. Because it generates the wealth stars, income tends to be steady and to grow with reputation rather than with risk. The person is not a natural saver, since enjoyment is the point, but is rarely reckless either. The leaks are food, comfort, and generosity. With a wealth star in the chart to receive the output, talent turns into a reliable business; without one, the work is admired more than it is paid.",
    career: "Cooking and hospitality, teaching, nursing and care, the arts and crafts, writing, design, agriculture, and any trade where a skilled hand produces something tangible suit Eating God. It also does well in roles that de-escalate conflict, because the star tames Seven Killings; mediation, customer relations, and counseling draw on this. High-pressure hierarchies are less comfortable, and the person may quietly underperform in jobs that offer no pleasure in the making. Long, patient careers built on mastery are the natural shape.",
